 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Saibai Cheat de Saikyou Saien ~E, Tada no Katei Saien desu kedo?~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "栽培チートで最強菜園～え、ただの家庭菜園ですけど?～"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Grew the Greatest Home Garden with my OP Cultivation Skill?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Gio, a young man from the village, is given a completely useless gift of a called  \"Vegetable Garden\" on the day he turns 15. Gio, who had dreamed of becoming an adventurer ever since he was a child, heads home disappointed... But when he activates the gift in his deserted garden --- in an instant, a lush of fresh vegetable grows! And then, \"Eh, there's meat on the tree!?\" \"A strong golem has also sprouted!??\" And the surprises just keep on coming! Isn't it great to have a vegetable garden filled with amazing skills?",
   "ja": "【家庭菜園】という全く役に立たなそうなギフトを、15歳の成人の日に与えられた村の青年・ジオ。幼い頃から冒険者を夢見ていたジオは、ガッカリしながら帰路につく…しかし、さびれた庭でギフトを発動したら―――一瞬でみずみずしい超絶品の野菜が育つ!!さらに「えっ、木に肉がなってる!?」「屈強なゴーレムも生えてきた!??」と、驚きの連続！こんなトンデモなスキル満載の家庭菜園だなんて…最高なのでは？あほかわ妹と、幼なじみと、おいしいスローライフを始めます！"
  },
